---
import MiniMonitor from './illustrations/MiniMonitor.astro';
import Cursor from './illustrations/Cursor.astro';
---

<section id="features" class="section" aria-labelledby="features-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
      <h2 id="features-title">One job, done carefully. <span class="soft">Placing windows.</span></h2>
    </header>

    <ul class="grid">
      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pair">
            <MiniMonitor layout="priority" />
            <MiniMonitor layout="grid" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>A layout for every monitor</h3>
        <p>Each monitor keeps its own layouts. Unplug one, plug it back in, and its layouts return.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="tpls">
            <div class="ill-ed__thumb"><i style="--x:4%;--w:45%" /><i style="--x:51%;--w:45%" /></div>
            <div class="ill-ed__thumb"><i style="--x:4%;--w:29%" /><i style="--x:35.5%;--w:29%" /><i style="--x:67%;--w:29%" /></div>
            <div class="ill-ed__thumb">
              <i style="--x:4%;--y:8%;--w:44%;--h:40%" /><i style="--x:52%;--y:8%;--w:44%;--h:40%" />
              <i style="--x:4%;--y:52%;--w:44%;--h:40%" /><i style="--x:52%;--y:52%;--w:44%;--h:40%" />
            </div>
            <div class="ill-ed__thumb"><i style="--x:4%;--w:21%" /><i style="--x:27%;--w:46%" /><i style="--x:75%;--w:21%" /></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>A visual zone editor</h3>
        <p>Start from halves, thirds, a 2x2 grid or priority, or split and drag the dividers until it fits. Undo and save as you go.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="edge ill-wrap">
            <div class="ill-monitor ill-monitor--mini">
              <div class="ill-desk">
                <div class="ill-work">
                  <span class="ill-zone ill-zone--solid" style="--x:0.8%;--w:48.6%" />
                  <span class="ill-zone ill-zone--soft" style="--x:50.6%;--w:48.6%" />
                  <Cursor x="1%" y="38%" />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Edge snapping, if you want it</h3>
        <p>Drag to a side for a half, a corner for a quarter, the top to maximize. Off by default, and never on the border between two monitors.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="motion" viewBox="0 0 220 90" focusable="false">
            <rect class="ghost" x="6" y="22" width="52" height="46" rx="6"></rect>
            <rect class="ghost g2" x="52" y="22" width="52" height="46" rx="6"></rect>
            <rect class="now" x="106" y="12" width="108" height="66" rx="7"></rect>
            <path class="trail" d="M60 45h38"></path>
            <path class="trail" d="M94 39l7 6-7 6"></path>
          </svg>
          <div class="art-label"><span>about 120 ms</span><span>or instant</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3>Animated or instant</h3>
        <p>Windows ease into place in about 120 ms, or jump there at once. It is one setting.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="keys">
            <kbd class="on">Shift</kbd><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>Alt</kbd><kbd>Win</kbd>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Your key</h3>
        <p>Shift by default. Switch to Ctrl, Alt or the Windows key (Command on a Mac) if Shift is taken.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="card">
        <div class="art" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pair">
            <MiniMonitor layout="thirds" label="100%" />
            <MiniMonitor layout="thirds" label="150%" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3>Careful with windows</h3>
        <p>On Windows, Krova accounts for mixed-DPI monitors, the invisible borders around windows, each app&rsquo;s own minimum and maximum size, and the taskbar.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="also">
      Also: a tray icon with launch at login. Light and dark follow your system. Minimized, fullscreen and administrator
      windows are skipped.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }

  .card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: var(--space-s);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  }

  .art {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 11rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);
    padding: var(--space-m);
    border-radius: var(--radius-l);
    background: var(--color-surface-2);
  }

  .card h3 {
    padding-inline: var(--space-xs);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
  }

  .card p {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xs);
    padding: 0 var(--space-xs) var(--space-xs);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 18rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .tpls {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 14rem;
  }
  .tpls .ill-ed__thumb {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .edge {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 12rem;
  }

  .motion {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 15rem;
    height: auto;
  }
  .motion .ghost {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--ill-line-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  .motion .ghost.g2 {
    opacity: 0.45;
  }
  .motion .now {
    fill: var(--ill-hi-fill);
    stroke: var(--ill-hi-stroke);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .motion .trail {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-text-soft);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .art-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 15rem;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  .keys {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .keys kbd {
    min-width: 3rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .keys kbd.on {
    border-color: var(--ill-key-on-edge);
    background: var(--ill-key-on-bg);
    color: var(--ill-key-on-text);
  }

  .also {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: var(--space-l) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-soft);
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
